<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Third-party licences of planetrs</title>
<style>
body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 60rem; color: #222; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f6f6f4; padding: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
li { margin: 0.2rem 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>planetrs is MIT. It is built on the crates below, each under its own licence, reproduced here.
Map data is &copy; OpenStreetMap contributors, under the ODbL 1.0:
<a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">openstreetmap.org/copyright</a>.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>Licence texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<section>
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
